# This repository IS the webroot. Anything committed here is a file nginx will
# be asked to serve, so the ignore list is a security control, not tidiness.
#
# Editor and backup droppings — the exact class of file that caused the
# 2026-08-08 webroot exposure on the ita vhost. The nginx config 404s them too;
# this is the second layer.
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak-*
*.orig
*.rej
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Working files that must never reach a webroot
*.tmp
scratch/
staging/

# If a build step is ever added, its inputs do not belong here
node_modules/
package-lock.json
